WEBVTT

00:00:10.625 --> 00:00:12.292
Oh my god!

00:00:12.875 --> 00:00:13.875
"Quack"

00:00:16.458 --> 00:00:20.458
Actually, I ended up
having this thing made.

00:00:22.667 --> 00:00:25.292
So, don't say anything,
don't speak a word

00:00:25.292 --> 00:00:28.625
and bring her
back into the show again.

00:00:28.625 --> 00:00:32.917
What are you talking about?!
She got blown up last time!

00:00:32.917 --> 00:00:35.792
It's absurd to bring her back again now!

00:00:35.792 --> 00:00:38.000
Just how many did
you have manufactured?

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:39.125
Twenty thousand of them!

00:00:39.125 --> 00:00:41.958
It's already being
mass-produced in China.

00:00:41.958 --> 00:00:45.208
They're being made one
after another, even as we speak,

00:00:45.208 --> 00:00:47.667
and we can't turn back now.

00:00:47.667 --> 00:00:50.500
Sir, just this once!
Please have mercy on us, just this once!

00:00:50.500 --> 00:00:51.708
Give us permission to prop up the show!

00:00:51.708 --> 00:00:53.042
Sir!

00:00:55.958 --> 00:00:57.750
"odkiR ihsoK"

00:01:08.625 --> 00:01:12.542
<i>That isn't love</i>

00:01:12.542 --> 00:01:16.375
<i>Love isn't that</i>

00:01:16.375 --> 00:01:24.292
<i>I am in love, but I am not loved</i>

00:01:24.292 --> 00:01:28.167
<i>Definitely isn't love</i>

00:01:28.167 --> 00:01:32.167
<i>Derriere isn't love</i>

00:01:32.167 --> 00:01:39.875
<i>I want to be loved,</i>
<i>but I never seek it out</i>

00:01:40.833 --> 00:01:44.708
<i>I offer myself and throw my life away</i>

00:01:44.708 --> 00:01:48.708
<i>Looking neither left nor right,</i>
<i>I will just earnestly</i>

00:01:48.708 --> 00:01:52.708
<i>Cheat, wheedle, interfere</i>

00:01:52.708 --> 00:01:55.917
<i>And trample down and</i>
<i>kick strangers</i>

00:01:55.917 --> 00:01:58.167
<i>And we get the hell out!</i>
<i>(And we get the hell out!)</i>

00:01:58.167 --> 00:02:00.083
<i>And we get the hell out!</i>
<i>(And we get the hell out!)</i>

00:02:00.083 --> 00:02:01.792
<i>And we get the hell out!</i>
<i>(And we get the hell out!)</i>

00:02:01.792 --> 00:02:03.833
<i>And we get the hell out!</i>

00:02:03.833 --> 00:02:08.583
<i>Even if I slip on a banana peel</i>

00:02:08.583 --> 00:02:11.792
<i>It is all for his sake anyway</i>

00:02:11.792 --> 00:02:16.292
<i>If anything, that is probably</i>

00:02:16.292 --> 00:02:24.125
<i>A kind of loyalty called love</i>

00:02:37.958 --> 00:02:42.167
Damn it, it's a new morning,
a morning of hope.

00:02:47.167 --> 00:02:49.958
Hey, it's a nice morning!

00:02:49.958 --> 00:02:53.167
What the hell are you doing
by my bedside, you bastard?!

00:02:53.167 --> 00:02:54.875
You're so coldhearted.

00:02:54.875 --> 00:02:57.833
Your coworker is dead and
you just keep sleeping peacefully.

00:02:57.833 --> 00:02:59.917
She didn't die!

00:02:59.917 --> 00:03:01.625
She just broke!

00:03:01.625 --> 00:03:03.167
Besides, you call her a coworker,

00:03:03.167 --> 00:03:05.458
but she wasn't even around for half a day!

00:03:05.458 --> 00:03:07.500
Time wasn't an issue.

00:03:07.500 --> 00:03:11.417
She and I were bound
somewhere deep within our hearts.

00:03:11.417 --> 00:03:15.417
Who cares? After all, we got a
new model of Ropponmatsu now.

00:03:15.417 --> 00:03:18.542
That's not my Ropponmatsu! It's a fake!

00:03:18.542 --> 00:03:20.375
Please beware of imitations!

00:03:20.375 --> 00:03:21.875
--Okay, this is the place!
--Please do not return goods after

00:03:21.875 --> 00:03:23.875
--All right, all right!
--seven days from the date of purchase.

00:03:28.000 --> 00:03:29.000
What's that?

00:03:29.000 --> 00:03:31.000
Someone's moving in,
from the look of it.

00:03:31.625 --> 00:03:35.333
Okay, okay, everyone,
work hard carrying everything in!

00:03:35.333 --> 00:03:37.000
That damn knockoff!

00:03:37.000 --> 00:03:38.792
Is this for real?

00:03:38.792 --> 00:03:40.833
Don't drop anything!

00:03:40.833 --> 00:03:42.000
If you break something,

00:03:42.000 --> 00:03:43.875
you'll have to work it
off for the rest of your life!

00:03:43.875 --> 00:03:48.833
Come on now, do what
you've been paid to do! Work! Work!

00:03:48.833 --> 00:03:49.750
Hey!

00:03:49.750 --> 00:03:50.750
Oh, good morning!

00:03:50.750 --> 00:03:54.250
What are you here for?!
This is our, our apartment!

00:03:54.250 --> 00:03:59.667
Well, you see, I'm moving in today,
so let's be good neighbors!

00:03:59.667 --> 00:04:03.208
Go back, you knockoff!
Don't show your face to me again!

00:04:04.792 --> 00:04:07.042
W-W-What?

00:04:07.042 --> 00:04:09.083
Don't say that.

00:04:09.083 --> 00:04:11.875
Let's all just be good friends,
Iwatchi, Watapii!

00:04:11.875 --> 00:04:13.208
Who the hell is Iwatchi?!

00:04:13.208 --> 00:04:14.708
And Watapii?!

00:04:16.083 --> 00:04:18.083
Sumiyoshi, you traitor!

00:04:18.083 --> 00:04:20.750
"I'm just helping a coworker move."

00:04:22.042 --> 00:04:23.625
Sumi-<i>chan</i>, thanks!

00:04:25.083 --> 00:04:26.875
Ropponmatsu!

00:04:30.375 --> 00:04:32.375
Iwatchi's such a crybaby.

00:04:33.167 --> 00:04:34.292
"But still,"

00:04:34.292 --> 00:04:36.875
"why are you moving into this place?"

00:04:37.208 --> 00:04:39.292
Well, because Master said,

00:04:39.292 --> 00:04:42.083
“Go become familiar
with the human world.”

00:04:42.208 --> 00:04:43.750
"Human world..."

00:04:43.750 --> 00:04:46.292
Don't drop my stuff, okay, Sumi-<i>chan</i>?

00:04:51.000 --> 00:04:53.292
It seems like they're getting along fine.

00:04:53.292 --> 00:04:55.375
It doesn't look that way to me.

00:04:55.375 --> 00:04:58.083
Weren't you able to fix her
to the way she was before?

00:04:58.083 --> 00:05:01.417
Sure, I could have.
And I have a spare one as well.

00:05:01.417 --> 00:05:02.583
Then why?

00:05:02.583 --> 00:05:04.917
It's a matter of taste, of course.

00:05:07.333 --> 00:05:11.583
Fix the spare one too,
as soon as possible.

00:05:11.583 --> 00:05:14.750
Well, if you insist, Sir.

00:05:16.208 --> 00:05:17.750
By noon.

00:05:17.750 --> 00:05:18.750
That's fast.

00:05:18.750 --> 00:05:20.667
Dwiver, let's go!

00:05:20.667 --> 00:05:22.458
Okay!

00:05:22.458 --> 00:05:24.000
Here we go!

00:05:24.000 --> 00:05:25.125
Beep beep!

00:05:25.125 --> 00:05:25.875
--Beep beep!

00:05:25.875 --> 00:05:27.542
--It's so fun! Right?
--Beep beep!

00:05:27.542 --> 00:05:28.542
Right?

00:05:28.542 --> 00:05:30.792
Hail, Ilpalazzo!

00:05:30.792 --> 00:05:32.000
Zzo...

00:05:34.500 --> 00:05:37.375
I-I am very sorry, Lord Ilpalazzo!

00:05:37.375 --> 00:05:38.875
The huge failure the
other day was due to me

00:05:38.875 --> 00:05:40.875
getting carried away by
my youth, chest hair tastes rich!

00:05:40.875 --> 00:05:42.750
I will not make excuses for
myself, but if possible,

00:05:42.750 --> 00:05:45.458
I would like you to have
mercy on me just this once!

00:05:45.458 --> 00:05:48.458
Our last mission had
some problems in its execution,

00:05:48.458 --> 00:05:51.167
but it can be considered a
success in some ways.

00:05:51.167 --> 00:05:52.542
You did well.

00:05:52.542 --> 00:05:54.625
What did you just say?

00:05:54.625 --> 00:05:56.625
You-did-well.

00:06:03.500 --> 00:06:04.500
"In Celebration of Victory"

00:06:11.500 --> 00:06:13.583
W-What blessed words!

00:06:13.583 --> 00:06:16.958
I, Excel, will not wash the
ear that heard that for a while!

00:06:17.833 --> 00:06:19.167
However,

00:06:19.167 --> 00:06:23.250
today's success will probably
involve a large element of chance.

00:06:23.250 --> 00:06:24.000
D'oh!

00:06:24.000 --> 00:06:28.458
Therefore, for City Conquest Plan #5227,

00:06:28.458 --> 00:06:32.333
we will modify the deployment somewhat.

00:06:32.333 --> 00:06:33.833
That rope is...

00:06:35.583 --> 00:06:37.667
Damn it, I ain't falling!
Damn it, I ain't falling!

00:06:37.667 --> 00:06:40.833
Damn it, I ain't falling!
Damn it, I ain't falling!

00:06:41.667 --> 00:06:45.042
This is the Compulsory
Delivery Robot, T-10000.

00:06:47.417 --> 00:06:50.542
I would like to have
the delivery made with this.

00:06:50.542 --> 00:06:52.125
Then, what about us?

00:06:52.125 --> 00:06:56.458
I'd like you to escort the T-10000
and see that it arrives safely.

00:06:56.458 --> 00:06:57.500
Excel...

00:06:57.500 --> 00:06:58.667
Yes?

00:06:58.667 --> 00:07:02.708
Prevent any obstruction,
with your life if necessary.

00:07:02.708 --> 00:07:03.875
Yes, Sir!

00:07:03.875 --> 00:07:06.167
<i>My life is worth less than a robot.</i>

00:07:06.167 --> 00:07:10.542
Then I will look forward to
your success, Hyatt and T-10000.

00:07:12.375 --> 00:07:16.042
Yes, yes, I got it!
Excel will do her best!

00:07:16.833 --> 00:07:20.042
Crushed!

00:07:20.042 --> 00:07:24.167
L-Lord Ilpalazzo, I believe
ignoring me is just too cruel.

00:07:24.167 --> 00:07:26.417
Please, some kind of reaction...

00:07:26.417 --> 00:07:30.000
Yes, this is good enough for me!

00:07:36.708 --> 00:07:38.875
Let me formally introduce you.

00:07:38.875 --> 00:07:42.625
This is Ropponmatsu.
She'll be working with you starting today.

00:07:42.625 --> 00:07:45.583
Hi! I'm Ropponmatsu!

00:07:45.583 --> 00:07:47.292
Any questions?

00:07:47.292 --> 00:07:49.000
I've got way too many,

00:07:49.000 --> 00:07:52.000
but I'm not even sure they're
questions I should be asking.

00:07:52.792 --> 00:07:55.417
Unnecessary probing leads
to problems later.

00:07:55.417 --> 00:07:57.250
Yeah, I know that, but...

00:07:58.125 --> 00:08:02.208
It's a lie! You're no Ropponmatsu!

00:08:02.208 --> 00:08:03.542
Absolutely not!

00:08:03.542 --> 00:08:05.667
Just get over it already.

00:08:05.667 --> 00:08:07.083
He's right.

00:08:07.083 --> 00:08:09.583
It's like an electronic
appliance being miniaturized.

00:08:09.583 --> 00:08:11.917
Oh, Big Sister, that's awful!

00:08:11.917 --> 00:08:17.125
Well, just be temporarily nice
to this Ropponmatsu.

00:08:18.708 --> 00:08:21.292
Didn't he just say something troubling?

00:08:21.292 --> 00:08:22.875
"Does that mean a different Ropponmatsu"

00:08:22.875 --> 00:08:24.667
"will be comin' eventually?"

00:08:24.667 --> 00:08:26.333
What are we gonna do if our workplace

00:08:26.333 --> 00:08:28.792
becomes full of
Ropponmatsus at this rate?

00:08:28.792 --> 00:08:30.708
"Don't make me think about it."

00:08:30.708 --> 00:08:33.000
You've got a dumb looking face.

00:08:33.000 --> 00:08:35.958
What're those ear-ish things anyway?

00:08:35.958 --> 00:08:38.125
Aren't they cute?

00:08:38.125 --> 00:08:39.833
That's just offensive!

00:08:39.833 --> 00:08:41.542
If you've got time
to put those things on,

00:08:41.542 --> 00:08:44.542
chew peanuts with your eyes and
eat spaghetti through your nose!

00:08:44.542 --> 00:08:45.958
Without wasting any!

00:08:45.958 --> 00:08:47.958
I can do that!

00:08:50.000 --> 00:08:52.833
S-Stop it!

00:08:53.667 --> 00:08:54.833
What's that?!

00:08:54.833 --> 00:08:55.625
--Is it some kind of advertisement?

00:08:55.625 --> 00:08:58.292
--Call the police! The police!
--Is it some kind of advertisement?

00:09:01.833 --> 00:09:04.792
It's sad how much attention we
seem to have attracted after all.

00:09:04.792 --> 00:09:08.333
It's only a matter of time before
our mission gets bogged down.

00:09:08.333 --> 00:09:09.625
We can't have that!

00:09:09.625 --> 00:09:11.833
If we don't get to the destination again,

00:09:11.833 --> 00:09:15.167
we'll definitely be
reprimanded by Lord Ilpalazzo!

00:09:15.167 --> 00:09:17.667
Do you have any ideas, Senior?

00:09:23.208 --> 00:09:25.000
Momma!

00:09:25.000 --> 00:09:27.958
Oh, Yoshio-<i>chan</i>!

00:09:27.958 --> 00:09:33.000
Help! Help! Someone, please stop it!

00:09:33.000 --> 00:09:36.292
Oh, I had a flash of inspiration!

00:09:36.292 --> 00:09:37.792
Too painful...

00:09:40.792 --> 00:09:42.500
Now, it'll all be fine!

00:09:43.208 --> 00:09:46.458
It's an adorable panda,
no matter how you look at it!

00:09:46.458 --> 00:09:48.875
Well, I think it is good
that it is adorable, but...

00:09:48.875 --> 00:09:50.333
Oh, it's a panda!

00:09:50.333 --> 00:09:51.000
--It's white!

00:09:51.000 --> 00:09:52.667
--Parts are black!
--It's white!

00:09:53.500 --> 00:09:55.208
Ah, it's a panda!

00:09:55.208 --> 00:09:56.125
It's a panda!

00:09:56.125 --> 00:09:57.708
It's a panda!

00:09:57.708 --> 00:10:00.208
I get the feeling the problem
of attracting too much attention

00:10:00.208 --> 00:10:01.875
has somehow not been solved.

00:10:02.583 --> 00:10:04.708
And it actually seems to
be getting worse.

00:10:04.708 --> 00:10:06.375
Yay, it's a panda!

00:10:10.083 --> 00:10:13.833
Oh! Look what the adorable
panda did to that child!

00:10:13.833 --> 00:10:16.833
That was something
of a borderline depiction.

00:10:22.250 --> 00:10:24.958
Mercy me!

00:10:24.958 --> 00:10:28.750
It's become a rather
unexpectedly sensational situation.

00:10:28.750 --> 00:10:30.708
What shall we do?

00:10:31.458 --> 00:10:33.667
Let's turn around
our way of thinking.

00:10:33.667 --> 00:10:37.292
We'll speed things up
and swiftly get to our destination!

00:10:37.292 --> 00:10:40.542
Hatchan, help me as much
as you can without dying!

00:10:43.750 --> 00:10:45.583
I'm an acceleration machine!

00:10:45.583 --> 00:10:48.917
Senior, I am getting motion sick.

00:10:48.917 --> 00:10:51.500
Damn it, who cares?! I'm accelerating!

00:10:51.500 --> 00:10:53.667
Out of the way! Out of the way!

00:10:57.208 --> 00:10:59.792
Yay, it's my desk!

00:11:03.375 --> 00:11:06.958
If I close my eyes,
you are there even now.

00:11:08.792 --> 00:11:10.292
Senior Iwata...

00:11:11.625 --> 00:11:15.750
Having lost you, I understand
how precious you were.

00:11:15.750 --> 00:11:18.000
Oh, Ropponmatsu!

00:11:18.792 --> 00:11:19.708
What?

00:11:19.708 --> 00:11:24.500
Not you! Change your name
this instant to Roboko Robota!

00:11:24.500 --> 00:11:26.958
Iwatchi, you're so selfish.

00:11:26.958 --> 00:11:28.292
That brat!

00:11:28.292 --> 00:11:32.542
Big Sister, the mean
Senior is being mean to me.

00:11:32.542 --> 00:11:35.250
You're on my side, right?

00:11:35.500 --> 00:11:38.083
"That's a rare reaction."

00:11:39.833 --> 00:11:42.375
--I don't deal well with people

00:11:42.375 --> 00:11:45.375
--Don't touch her! That's mine too!
--who don't fit into the hierarchy.

00:11:49.750 --> 00:11:51.958
This is such a rowdy workplace.

00:11:54.833 --> 00:11:56.500
I can hear it.

00:12:01.583 --> 00:12:02.667
Bathroom?

00:12:02.667 --> 00:12:03.583
Who knows?

00:12:03.583 --> 00:12:06.000
The hell you're propping!

00:12:06.000 --> 00:12:10.250
I'd rather die than
work with a brat like that!

00:12:37.083 --> 00:12:39.708
I can't... breathe...

00:12:39.708 --> 00:12:43.250
Am I... going to...

00:12:58.750 --> 00:13:00.917
M-Ms. Will...

00:13:00.917 --> 00:13:03.250
Take my oxygen.

00:13:03.250 --> 00:13:08.542
No. Ms. Will, no.
If you do that, then you'll also...

00:13:08.542 --> 00:13:11.000
Even so, please live.

00:13:11.000 --> 00:13:13.958
You're already dead, but please live!

00:13:13.958 --> 00:13:15.625
Ms. Will...

00:13:29.292 --> 00:13:30.583
Hey, it stopped!

00:13:30.583 --> 00:13:33.750
That means this has
got to be the destination.

00:13:33.750 --> 00:13:37.625
Hey, Hatchan, we're here.
Did you get motion sick?

00:13:38.958 --> 00:13:42.292
And she's dead again,
as if planned from the start!

00:13:42.292 --> 00:13:46.292
W-Well, our mission should
be accomplished now, right?!

00:13:49.208 --> 00:13:52.125
Again? What in
the world is going on?

00:13:52.125 --> 00:13:53.083
I don't know.

00:13:53.083 --> 00:13:57.250
But say, if we don't take care of it,
a lot of people might die.

00:13:57.250 --> 00:13:58.375
I understand.

00:13:58.375 --> 00:14:02.000
Dismantle it quickly.
But be very cautious, all right?

00:14:02.000 --> 00:14:03.625
I will head there later as well.

00:14:03.625 --> 00:14:05.125
Okay!

00:14:06.458 --> 00:14:09.417
Kabapu is just a bit worried-worried.

00:14:09.417 --> 00:14:13.250
♪ Dismantle, dismantle!
Dismantle a bomb! ♪

00:14:13.250 --> 00:14:16.542
♪ If you're red, then I'm blue! ♪

00:14:16.542 --> 00:14:19.125
♪ Oops, there's only three seconds left! ♪

00:14:19.125 --> 00:14:23.083
♪ Make a careless mistake and
it's a huge explosion! ♪

00:14:23.083 --> 00:14:24.250
Oh?

00:14:29.833 --> 00:14:34.292
Timer device in operation.
812 seconds until detonation.

00:14:47.083 --> 00:14:48.583
How dare you?!

00:14:50.292 --> 00:14:54.208
Hot, hot, hot, hot!
Someone put it out! Put it out!

00:14:54.208 --> 00:14:56.042
Hot, hot, hot, hot!

00:14:57.833 --> 00:14:59.708
Damn it!

00:14:59.708 --> 00:15:00.958
Wha-What the heck?!

00:15:00.958 --> 00:15:02.500
It's a panda!

00:15:02.500 --> 00:15:03.625
"For real."

00:15:06.542 --> 00:15:09.208
Hey, they're like
going at it over there!

00:15:09.208 --> 00:15:11.792
I have a bad feeling about this.

00:15:12.458 --> 00:15:15.542
Big Sister, stay back!
This guy's a time bomb!

00:15:15.542 --> 00:15:17.042
A-A bomb?!

00:15:21.333 --> 00:15:24.125
Why again?! And why is it a panda?!

00:15:24.125 --> 00:15:26.208
"It's more troublesome
than the one before..."

00:15:26.750 --> 00:15:30.250
Don't worry. I'll dismantle it real quick.

00:15:40.042 --> 00:15:42.542
Hey, maybe we should call the police?

00:15:42.542 --> 00:15:44.542
There is no need for that.

00:15:48.125 --> 00:15:51.333
Ropponmatsu is an expert
at dismantling bombs.

00:15:51.333 --> 00:15:54.917
No need to worry.
Surely, no need. Probably, no need.

00:15:54.917 --> 00:15:58.125
Last time, we failed big
time by doing the same thing!

00:16:00.917 --> 00:16:02.417
Learning from those mistakes,

00:16:02.417 --> 00:16:04.833
she has been built lightweight this time.

00:16:04.833 --> 00:16:08.250
And the concept of increasing
durability was taken in.

00:16:08.250 --> 00:16:09.500
The development slogan was:

00:16:09.500 --> 00:16:11.708
“It will be hard to break, even
if an elephant steps on it.”

00:16:11.708 --> 00:16:14.417
"It's just a tad bit difficult to
feel conviction in those words."

00:16:20.292 --> 00:16:23.375
"Iwata's Self-Centered Flashback"

00:16:23.375 --> 00:16:28.042
Senior! Senior, please run! I will...

00:16:28.042 --> 00:16:30.667
You idiot! How could
I run and leave you behind?!

00:16:30.667 --> 00:16:33.833
No! I want you to be safe!

00:16:33.833 --> 00:16:34.792
"Iwata's Self-Centered Flashback"
"Omitted"

00:16:34.792 --> 00:16:39.083
"Iwata's Self-Centered Flashback"

00:16:39.083 --> 00:16:42.125
Ropponmatsu!

00:16:42.125 --> 00:16:47.333
Senior, I am happy to have met you.

00:16:47.333 --> 00:16:50.083
What are you saying? Hey!

00:16:50.083 --> 00:16:57.708
You taught me what a human heart is.

00:16:57.708 --> 00:16:59.417
Ropponmatsu...

00:16:59.417 --> 00:17:01.958
Senior, one last time...

00:17:07.250 --> 00:17:10.417
Hey, why are you tripping
uselessly by yourself?!

00:17:15.542 --> 00:17:17.500
I can't stand to watch anymore!

00:17:17.500 --> 00:17:20.083
Isn't there something that can be done?!

00:17:28.167 --> 00:17:30.000
Stop!

00:17:30.000 --> 00:17:33.833
If you pick on her any more,
I won't let you get away with it!

00:17:33.833 --> 00:17:35.583
Iwatchi?!

00:17:39.000 --> 00:17:40.542
"Watanabe Life"

00:17:43.125 --> 00:17:44.792
It's complete!

00:17:46.667 --> 00:17:50.292
Now, Yumiko-<i>chan</i>,
let's try pushing the launch button.

00:17:50.292 --> 00:17:51.917
Okay!

00:17:51.917 --> 00:17:53.250
Here I go!

00:18:12.542 --> 00:18:14.625
Ropponmatsu!

00:18:14.625 --> 00:18:17.750
That man is as punctual as ever.

00:18:17.750 --> 00:18:21.000
Ropponmatsu!

00:18:22.917 --> 00:18:24.292
Ropponmatsu...

00:18:25.708 --> 00:18:28.042
I will begin the dismantling job.

00:18:28.042 --> 00:18:30.542
It will be dangerous,
so please stay back.

00:18:30.542 --> 00:18:31.167
--Okay.

00:18:31.167 --> 00:18:32.500
--Has she been fixed?
--Okay.

00:18:32.500 --> 00:18:33.833
Probably.

00:18:35.250 --> 00:18:36.917
Big Sister, who are you?

00:18:36.917 --> 00:18:38.250
I am Ropponmatsu.

00:18:38.250 --> 00:18:39.917
I'm Ropponmatsu too.

00:18:41.542 --> 00:18:42.917
Sister!

00:18:45.792 --> 00:18:47.792
"Ooh!"

00:18:47.792 --> 00:18:49.583
Good going!

00:18:49.583 --> 00:18:52.833
It seems that the
repairs were a success.

00:18:52.833 --> 00:18:54.167
Of course!

00:18:58.625 --> 00:19:00.750
I did not just repair her.

00:19:00.750 --> 00:19:03.083
I also upgraded her
based on the data.

00:19:03.083 --> 00:19:05.167
Her reaction time and response
patterns to each situation

00:19:05.167 --> 00:19:07.667
have also been further improved.

00:19:08.542 --> 00:19:11.208
You could even call her
New Ropponmatsu.

00:19:11.208 --> 00:19:12.708
Knew?

00:19:12.708 --> 00:19:13.750
New.

00:19:13.750 --> 00:19:14.917
Who is that?

00:19:14.917 --> 00:19:18.458
Her creator, Gojo Shioji.

00:19:18.458 --> 00:19:20.458
You made that thing?

00:19:21.042 --> 00:19:22.792
"I see... So it's his preference..."

00:19:23.625 --> 00:19:25.542
Now, go, Ropponmatsu!

00:19:25.542 --> 00:19:29.333
And this time, execute your
beautiful dismantling work!

00:19:29.333 --> 00:19:30.792
Roger, Sir.

00:19:37.375 --> 00:19:39.917
So strong!
You're strong, Ropponmatsu!

00:19:39.917 --> 00:19:41.208
"So, we've become"

00:19:41.208 --> 00:19:43.792
"So, we've become"
"unnecessary after all..."

00:19:43.792 --> 00:19:44.958
Don't say that.

00:19:44.958 --> 00:19:48.625
Not that I really feel like
joining in either.

00:19:48.625 --> 00:19:51.958
Commencing removal and
dismantling work.

00:19:55.958 --> 00:19:58.417
Sister, you're amazing!

00:19:58.417 --> 00:20:03.000
Analysis complete.
Detonation wire extracted. Timer nullified.

00:20:03.000 --> 00:20:06.417
It will be finished once I cut
the wire to the triggering device.

00:20:06.417 --> 00:20:07.500
Good work.

00:20:07.500 --> 00:20:09.875
Ropponmatsu, hurray!

00:20:15.958 --> 00:20:17.958
Sister!

00:20:50.875 --> 00:20:55.708
Oh, my! Good morning, Senior Excel.

00:20:55.708 --> 00:20:58.708
I'm becoming more and more
knowledgeable about medicine,

00:20:58.708 --> 00:21:00.875
despite my reluctance to do so.

00:21:00.875 --> 00:21:05.542
Senior, did today's mission succeed?

00:21:06.542 --> 00:21:08.042
Who knows?

00:21:26.250 --> 00:21:29.750
"Farewell, my summer..."

00:21:37.917 --> 00:21:41.083
And so, they will be returning
to work starting today.

00:21:41.083 --> 00:21:44.708
Ropponmatsu and Ropponmatsu.

00:21:44.708 --> 00:21:46.750
I am sorry to have troubled you.

00:21:46.750 --> 00:21:48.250
Hello, again!

00:21:49.417 --> 00:21:54.167
"Episode 15: More! Prop Memorial"
Give me a break already!

00:21:54.167 --> 00:21:56.042
"Episode 15: More! Prop Memorial"
"Today's Experiment..."

00:21:56.042 --> 00:21:57.750
"Episode 15: More! Prop Memorial"
"Today's Experiment... Failed"

00:22:00.083 --> 00:22:01.458
Shall we sing?

00:22:01.458 --> 00:22:02.792
Maybe we should.

00:22:02.792 --> 00:22:04.292
♪ That's no good. ♪

00:22:04.292 --> 00:22:05.500
♪ That's no good. ♪

00:22:05.500 --> 00:22:06.667
♪ That's no good. ♪

00:22:06.667 --> 00:22:08.625
♪ That's no good. ♪

00:22:08.625 --> 00:22:10.958
One, two, three, four.

00:22:10.958 --> 00:22:15.375
♪ No matter what we do,
it's no, no good. ♪

00:22:15.375 --> 00:22:19.583
♪ If we don't do it,
it's even more no, no good. ♪

00:22:19.583 --> 00:22:21.917
♪ Maybe we should quit. ♪

00:22:21.917 --> 00:22:24.083
♪ But we can't quit. ♪

00:22:24.083 --> 00:22:29.083
♪ It's no good, it's no good,
it's no, no good.

00:22:51.042 --> 00:22:59.417
<i>I knew, ever since that day</i>

00:22:59.417 --> 00:23:06.833
<i>The reason you had approached me</i>

00:23:06.833 --> 00:23:15.000
<i>Tender and soft</i>

00:23:15.000 --> 00:23:23.750
<i>That my body is to your taste</i>

00:23:24.708 --> 00:23:32.500
<i>To your hunger-stricken eyes</i>

00:23:32.500 --> 00:23:40.375
<i>How does my body seem</i>

00:23:40.375 --> 00:23:48.250
<i>If you are to eat me, do it in one blow</i>

00:23:48.250 --> 00:23:57.042
<i>So that the meat does not get hard</i>

00:23:59.167 --> 00:24:01.375
That's love! This is love!
And that's love too! Then so is this!

00:24:01.375 --> 00:24:03.000
Love comes in an
infinite variety of shapes!

00:24:03.000 --> 00:24:04.292
A free-for-all that needs no rules.

00:24:04.292 --> 00:24:06.750
In a square jungle called love,
the grapplers fight fiercely.

00:24:06.750 --> 00:24:08.875
I'm going to clang the bell
of my soul tonight too!

00:24:08.875 --> 00:24:10.083
I'm sorry, what the heck am I saying?!

00:24:10.083 --> 00:24:12.000
Well, anyway, man, woman, other animals.

00:24:12.000 --> 00:24:13.417
We think it's okay for all
sorts of combinations to exist!

00:24:13.417 --> 00:24:16.583
And so, we've decided to try our hand
at a bit of excitement between girls.

00:24:16.583 --> 00:24:19.083
In the red corner, we have
Excel and Hyatt, the ACROSS Team!

00:24:19.083 --> 00:24:22.042
In the blue corner, we have the
big and small Ropponmatsu Team!

00:24:22.042 --> 00:24:23.958
The happy, embarrassing
tug-of-war is a wild tussle!

00:24:23.958 --> 00:24:24.958
A midnight-ish anime.

00:24:24.958 --> 00:24:26.250
Next time: “Take Back Love!”

00:24:26.250 --> 00:24:28.594
You are shock!
